{{~##
   The opening markup every generated page shares.

   The stylesheet is inline rather than fetched, and rather than a file beside the pages.

   It used to be Bootstrap 4.3.1 from stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com, which has since shut
   down - so the pages have been rendering unstyled, and a golden comparison could not
   tell, because it checks that the markup has not changed and not that a URL still
   answers. Worse, the tool is expected to run on closed networks, which the history page
   two directories away says in a comment as its reason for reaching no CDN at all.

   Not the committed copy in lib/bootstrap-4.3.1-dist either. What these pages actually
   used of it was `container-fluid` and three table classes; `table-condensed` is a
   Bootstrap 3 name that 4.3.1 ignored, and `definition`, `comment` and `header-fixed`
   were never defined anywhere. Forty lines replaces 160 KB, and every page is then one
   file somebody can mail.

   Committed to light. The generated markup carries `<font color=blue>` and friends, so
   honouring a dark theme would put blue on near-black; `color-scheme` says so rather
   than leaving the browser to invert it.

   The first two lines and the title line are run together deliberately: the printer
   this replaced used Print rather than PrintLine for them, and the golden pages record
   the result.
##~}}
<!-- Generated by Tabbit - DO NOT EDIT. -->
<html><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<style>
:root { color-scheme: light; }
body {
  margin: 0; padding: 16px 20px 40px;
  background: #fff; color: #24292f;
  font: 14px/1.5 -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial,
        "Malgun Gothic", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif;
}
h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
h2 { font-size: 17px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 6px; }
h4 { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; color: #6e7781; margin: 24px 0 0; }
a { color: #0969da; text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; }
li { margin: 2px 0; }
code { font-family: Consolas, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px; }
.definition { margin: 0 0 6px; }
.comment { color: #57606a; margin: 0 0 8px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0; }
th, td {
  border: 1px solid #d0d7de; padding: 3px 8px;
  text-align: left; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;
}
th { background: #f6f8fa; font-weight: 600; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1; }
thead:nth-of-type(2) th { top: 25px; font-weight: 400; color: #57606a; }
thead:nth-of-type(3) th { top: 50px; font-weight: 400; }
thead:nth-of-type(4) th { top: 75px; font-weight: 400; }
tbody tr:nth-child(even), tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f6f8fa; }
tr:hover > td { background: #fff8c5; }
td[valign=top] { background: none; white-space: normal; }
</style>
<title>{{ title }}</title></head><body>
<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
